# **THIS DIRECTORY IS TRACKED. Nothing here is denied by default** (Tom, 2026-08-18).
#
# It used to open with `*` and a whitelist, on the reasoning that Tom drops real client models in
# here and a wholesale deny is the only thing that cannot be forgotten. He overruled it, and the
# reasoning was wrong on its own terms: the folder never goes to production, a file cannot leave this
# machine without somebody deliberately committing it, and the deny was silently eating the site
# plans he kept putting back. His ruling: *"The reaction was unjustified from the beginning… Reverse
# all that and merely let your scripts monitor for changes. I will let you know if I want to rename
# it."*
#
# **What replaces it is `dev/scripts/example_folder_check.php`**, which runs in check_all.sh and
# names every file here that is not one of the published examples or their sources. A client model
# appears in that list the moment it lands, which is a louder warning than a rule nobody reads.
#
# Windows leaves these beside anything downloaded through a browser. They are not ours and are not
# interesting.
*:Zone.Identifier
